{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>במקהלות</b> ע\"ש ויקהלו על משה ועל אהרן:" "<b> במקהלות</b> two times. Here and the other במקהלות ברכו אלהים. We derive from it that even the fetuses in the womb said Amen to the song at the Sea, and this is ויסעו מחרדה — meaning from the fear of Egypt, who was pursuing after them — ויחנו במקהלות — teaching that they became assembly after assembly to say the song."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:23:44.698839482Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}